<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>CrazyAMP · Profile</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/account.css"></head><body><main class="account-page"><a class="account-back" href="/">← Back to Coinflip</a><section class="profile-hero"><div class="profile-avatar"><% if(user.avatar){ %><img src="<%= user.avatar %>" alt=""><% } else { %><%= (user.username || "U").charAt(0) %><% } %></div><div><span>PLAYER PROFILE</span><h1><%= user.username || user.displayName %></h1><p><%= summary.gamesPlayed %> games played · <%= summary.gamesWon %> wins</p></div></section><section class="stat-grid"><article><span>Wagered</span><strong>💎 <%= summary.wagered.toLocaleString() %></strong></article><article><span>Deposited</span><strong>💎 <%= summary.deposited.toLocaleString() %></strong><small>Tracks your total deposited value</small></article><article><span>Withdrawn</span><strong>💎 <%= summary.withdrawn.toLocaleString() %></strong><small>Tracks your total withdrawn value</small></article><article class="<%= summary.profit >= 0 ? 'positive' : 'negative' %>"><span>Profit</span><strong><%= summary.profit >= 0 ? '+' : '-' %>💎 <%= Math.abs(summary.profit).toLocaleString() %></strong></article></section><a class="account-history-link" href="/history">View full game history →</a></main><%- include("partials/mobile-bottom-nav") %></body></html>
